# Paper voice

Write like a methods note that found a negative. Not a pitch deck.

- Results first when drafting. Intro last. Abstract last.
- Short sentences. An occasional long one. Do not start three paragraphs
  with the same cadence.
- Banned: delve, landscape, robustly, play a crucial role, it is worth
  noting, in this paper we, we propose a novel, multifaceted, leverage,
  underscore, three contributions.
- State the finding, then how we know. Do not announce a contribution list.
- Orfi & Sels belong in the intro as the reason a loss is unsurprising.
- First person plural only for things we did ("we enumerate 1024 models").
- Hedge only what we did not measure (IBM, live Trotter mixing at p>10).
  The p=10 gaps are not hedged.
- PIP error did not move. The posterior did. That register, once, not as a bit.
